Pages = {1245-1248},
Month = {OCT},
Abstract = {A TiNi shape memory alloy plate has been simulated at different
   crystallographic orientations in the free LAMMPS classical molecular
   dynamics simulator. It has been found that the crystallographic
   orientation of the plate significantly affects the phase transition
   temperature. The temperature dependence of the surface energy at the
   (100), (110), (112), and (122) crystallographic orientations has been
   built. The stability of the model used has been examined and thereby its
   applicability to the calculation made has been confirmed.},
