   heterojunction single-walled nanotube by comparing the binding energy.
   The energy band structure, electronic density of states and regulation
   relation between band gap and indirect-direct properties and tube
   diameter and type are systematically studied. Based on existing
   experimental and theoretical results, dynamic simulated calculating of
   the stitching process is carried out to explore the feasibility of
   controllable preparation.},
