   Stability analysis; Low-power electronics; Logic gates; SRAM; bitcell
   design; negative differential resistance (NDR); ultra-low power (ULP);
   ultra-low leakage (ULL); forward back bias (FBB); FD-SOI; power gating;
   data retention},
